  "info": {
    "description": "The Tamarind public API. Code-first: this spec is GENERATED from the backend `Public*` request/response models (the single source of truth) and committed as an artifact; a freshness gate asserts it matches the running server, and a contract test asserts the served routes match it. v1 is frozen for external users. Authenticate with an API key in the `x-api-key` header.",
